== Link
  Both solids are made from the same 20 hexagon planes of the TI frame. The OG is a pentakis dodecahedron whose 20 six-fold corners are cut at those planes so that neighbouring hexagons touch only at the 30 edge-midpoint corners (kites).
  The Fullerene Star's 60 triangle planes also form a pentakis dodecahedron, but its six-fold corners lie BELOW the hexagon planes (B/hexplane < 1), so no cut occurs: the FS is TI + 12 pyramids (union), reflex at all 60 hexagon-triangle edges; the OG has B/hexplane > 1 (cut).
